### ============================================================
### Distributed Job Queue System — API Tests
### ============================================================
### Install REST Client extension by Huachao Mao in VS Code
### Click "Send Request" above any request to test it
### ============================================================


### ============================================================
### HEALTH
### ============================================================

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health


### ============================================================
### SUBMIT JOBS
### ============================================================

### Submit a real email job
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "send_email",
  "payload": {
    "to": "mahi0518n@gmail.com",
    "subject": "Job Queue Test",
    "body": "This email was processed asynchronously by a background worker using Redis and BullMQ."
  }
}

###

### Submit a report job (simulated — completes successfully)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "generate_report",
  "payload": {
    "reportId": "q4-2026",
    "format": "pdf"
  }
}

###

### Submit an unknown job type (should return 400 immediately — fail fast)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "unknown_type",
  "payload": {}
}

###

### Submit a job with missing type (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "email": "test@example.com"
  }
}


### ============================================================
### JOB STATUS
### ============================================================

### Get a single job by ID — replace with a real ID
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID

###

### Get a completed job
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_COMPLETED_ID

###

### Get a dead job — should show errorMessage and failedAt
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_DEAD_ID


### ============================================================
### LIST JOBS
### ============================================================

### List all jobs (latest 50)
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs

###

### List only PENDING jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=PENDING

###

### List only PROCESSING jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=PROCESSING

###

### List only COMPLETED jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=COMPLETED

###

### List only DEAD jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=DEAD

###

### List only email jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?type=send_email

###

### List only completed email jobs (combine filters)
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=COMPLETED&type=send_email

###

### List only dead report jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=DEAD&type=generate_report


### ============================================================
### RETRY
### ============================================================

### Retry a dead job — replace with a real DEAD job ID
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/89f0dc4c-f678-417e-b89e-94c4f96860d5/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Try to retry a completed job — should return 400
### "Job cannot be retried — current status: COMPLETED"
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_COMPLETED_ID/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{}


